{{!
    @template local_uckk/public/aside

    Public aside region for local_uckk institutional pages.

    This template renders the public aside shell extracted from
    local_uckk/public_page.

    It is intentionally render-only.

    Current aside contract:
    * The aside renders metadata when hasmetadata is true.
    * The aside renders a call to action when hascta is true.
    * The aside does not render notices.
    * No local_uckk/public/notices partial is part of the current template set.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * asideclasses - Safe CSS classes for the aside element.
    * hasmetadata - Whether metadata should be rendered.
    * hascta - Whether the call to action should be rendered.

    Included partials:
    * local_uckk/public/metadata
    * local_uckk/public/cta
}}

<aside
    class="{{asideclasses}}"
    data-region="local-uckk-public-aside"
    aria-label="Repères institutionnels"
>
    <div class="local-uckk-public-aside__inner">
        {{#hasmetadata}}
            {{> local_uckk/public/metadata }}
        {{/hasmetadata}}

        {{#hascta}}
            {{> local_uckk/public/cta }}
        {{/hascta}}
    </div>
</aside>